00:30:39.950 --> 00:30:44.950
And just like the way like
lions will eat gazelles,

00:30:45.600 --> 00:30:50.600
some bacteria express molecules
that kill other bacteria.

00:30:51.650 --> 00:30:55.840
But they have to be
safe from that molecule.

00:30:55.840 --> 00:30:59.180
So they express their own resistance gene.

00:30:59.180 --> 00:31:02.290
It's like, if someone's
like, I don't know,

00:31:02.290 --> 00:31:04.250
