00:31:10.250 --> 00:31:14.020
and your like population has armor.

00:31:14.020 --> 00:31:17.900
So you express the arrow, the antibiotic,

00:31:17.900 --> 00:31:20.720
and the resistance gene, the armor.

00:31:20.720 --> 00:31:23.423
So we took this from another bacteria.

00:31:28.420 --> 00:31:29.633
Where we got it,

00:31:30.536 --> 00:31:32.840
we got that gene from a company.

00:31:32.840 --> 00:31:33.780
We ordered it,

00:31:33.780 --> 00:31:36.340
and they sent us a little
piece of DNA in a tube.

00:31:36.340 --> 00:31:38.750
And then we put it into our plasmid

00:31:38.750 --> 00:31:41.440
with some other like restriction enzymes,

00:31:41.440 --> 00:31:45.480
to cut up DNA, and the glue
to put it back together,

00:31:45.480 --> 00:31:48.253
a DNA ligase or gluing it together.

00:31:49.890 --> 00:31:52.240
But yeah, bacteria communicate,

00:31:52.240 --> 00:31:54.740
and they fight and they
like tell each other how

00:31:54.740 --> 00:31:56.490
and where to grow.

00:31:56.490 --> 00:31:59.770
So we can take a lot of things from them.

00:31:59.770 --> 00:32:03.680
